  "notes": [
    {
      "at": [
        -12,
        21
      ],
      "id": 54,
      "text": "ESP-IDF's I2C master driver on I2C0 (SCL GPIO5,\nSDA GPIO4, 4.7 kOhm pull-ups): an LM75 temperature\nsensor (0x48) and a 24C02 EEPROM (0x50).\nAnalyzer > UART (UART0) shows both chips found,\n\"EEPROM: SimNodus\" and the temperature every second;\nwhile running, drag the LM75 or turn the wheel over it.\nThe scope shows SCL and SDA at 100 kHz."
    }
  ],
